{"lines":[{"x":0.12923353260256107,"w":0.21680704752604166,"h":0.019246900039511128,"c":1,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.097030025045851231},{"c":1,"x":0.12757201996864354,"y":0.14244186027589589,"t":"TEST 4, WRITING TASK 1","w":0.33744855244954425,"h":0.020396772908097383},{"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","h":0.016046580212416783,"y":0.17726737341621579,"x":0.12757201004307508,"c":1,"w":0.65226338704427089},{"c":1,"h":0.018909044344377457,"t":"The chart demonstrates what Anthropology graduates from one university did after finishing their","x":0.12551439627888614,"y":0.20347467619138493,"w":0.76748972574869789},{"x":0.12551440444545922,"c":1,"t":"undergraduate degree course. The table indicates the salaries of the anthropologists in work after","w":0.76954732259114578,"y":0.22232037667623261,"h":0.018958692696687041},{"y":0.242638397969132,"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"5 years.","c":1,"x":0.12551440332721978,"w":0.065843620300292949},{"t":"As we can see trom the pie chart, majority of Anthropology graduates are employed. Fifty-two per","x":0.1255144125966359,"y":0.26884570087392534,"c":1,"h":0.018944996405827252,"w":0.77160491943359377},{"t":"cent of them have a full-time job. Almost twenty per cent of graduates have either a part-time","y":0.28769140137127325,"w":0.75102879842122405,"h":0.017667844522968323,"x":0.12551440724535184,"c":1},{"w":0.75308639526367194,"x":0.12551441539610436,"t":"work or it is combined with post grad study. Eight per cent of students continue their full-time","y":0.30668604689794876,"h":0.018991220966244726,"c":1},{"y":0.32407099672761008,"w":0.75940500895182306,"h":0.021750826436863879,"c":1,"t":"education. Only twelve per cent of graduates are unemployed. The information about all the rest","x":0.1254379247475749},{"w":0.17944469451904299,"x":0.12523602812681933,"y":0.34315200224125675,"c":1,"t":"graduates is unknown.","h":0.020328634057645956},{"w":0.75308639526367194,"h":0.017482948527880904,"c":1,"t":"Thus, most of Anthropology graduates have a job. Half of those who work in Government sector","x":0.12551441540994404,"y":0.37209302309611947},{"x":0.12540729814558774,"h":0.020563201994160174,"c":1,"w":0.773877665201823,"t":"earn more than a hundred thousand dollars. It is less than proportion of freelance concultantants","y":0.38938164210277459},{"x":0.12551439909722034,"y":0.41133720914288729,"h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.74897120157877595,"c":1,"t":"who get the same amount of money. Besides, it is only one-third of those who work for private"},{"h":0.017462404653236896,"t":"companies. We can see nearly the same percentage of those who get from fifty thousand dollars","x":0.12551440730918945,"w":0.75102879842122383,"y":0.43021201410462184,"c":1},{"x":0.12332658978439033,"h":0.022936997340621379,"y":0.44651659457701853,"w":0.75951665242513011,"t":"to ninty-nine thousand dollars as freelance consultants and in government sector. The situation","c":1},{"x":0.1254058028815617,"t":"is different in private companies. More of them get from fifly thousand to seventy-four thousand","h":0.021285468192488111,"c":1,"w":0.76356109619140622,"y":0.46692802887739893},{"h":0.019401015606308469,"t":"dollars than from seventy-five to ninety-nine thousand dollars. The proportion of those who work","y":0.48689312995597644,"x":0.12545283741258212,"w":0.77171417236328121,"c":1},{"t":"for private companies for from twenty-five thousand to forty-nine thousand dollars is half bigger","h":0.022005869727252603,"c":1,"y":0.50430971658138646,"x":0.12336162574586335,"w":0.77180648803710938},{"t":"than the same one in government sector and as freelancers.","y":0.52616279108452146,"w":0.47736623128255218,"x":0.12551441509772279,"h":0.01889534805351778,"c":1},{"h":0.021409431250833943,"x":0.12542972649836617,"y":0.5519573193721713,"w":0.78822672526041671,"c":1,"t":"So, the chart and the table show us that most of Anthropology graduates are employed and a salary"},{"x":0.12551440510664955,"w":0.48765431722005204,"h":0.018895348053517669,"c":1,"t":"more than twenty-five thousand dollars after five year's work.","y":0.57122093061755785},{"w":0.29218106587727866,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.011778563015312216,"x":0.1296296315116201,"y":0.60600706736659715},{"y":0.6395348835748883,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"x":0.16872428318614566,"w":0.69958847045898453,"t":"The candidate has described all the key features and has supported these with"},{"w":0.73045267740885422,"x":0.16666666524802565,"h":0.016034596379148724,"t":"relevant figures. There is some comparison of the figures in both the chart and the","y":0.65547703166775162,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"table. Information is presented coherently and there is a clear overall progression","x":0.16666665808636916,"y":0.67285041236483667,"w":0.72222223917643225,"h":0.016195524146054185},{"y":0.68742370252731244,"t":"(introduction, description of the pie chart information, description of the information","x":0.16657416553184826,"h":0.020093450557497561,"c":1,"w":0.73269866943359374},{"c":1,"y":0.7063953486909621,"w":0.69135803222656245,"t":"in the table and conclusion). Some cohesive devices are used to organise the","x":0.16666666279783773,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"x":0.168616820185606,"w":0.68332041422526046,"h":0.019907206612846506,"c":1,"t":"description [As we can see | Thus | Besides | So]. The range of vocabulary is","y":0.72100824837771027},{"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.72633743286132812,"t":"adequate for the task [combined with | earn | proportion of | freelancers], but there","y":0.73969375739822429,"x":0.16872428757211896},{"t":"are some errors [all the rest graduates \/ all the rest of the graduates | It is less \/","c":1,"x":0.16872429132802191,"y":0.75581395333936574,"w":0.70164606730143231,"h":0.015988372380376759},{"y":0.77325581380713804,"w":0.73045267740885422,"t":"more than (the) proportion of freelance.... same amount of money | concultantants","h":0.015988372380376759,"c":1,"x":0.16872427847389018},{"y":0.78823743683797587,"x":0.16656838196033211,"w":0.71417032877604159,"c":1,"t":"\/ consultants | ninty \/ ninety | half bigger than \/ twice as big as]. There is a mix of","h":0.019157507394312101},{"h":0.016046580212416672,"c":1,"t":"simple and complex sentence structures, with some errors [(the) majority | a part-","x":0.16872427939993354,"w":0.72427983601888024,"y":0.80668604636522279},{"x":0.16861439357587471,"t":"time work | all the rest (of the) graduates | in (the) Government sector].","w":0.62779444376627602,"h":0.019346225949704254,"c":1,"y":0.82082842910345488},{"x":0.12551440367344358,"y":0.91715116263226448,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"136"}],"w":2400,"h":3395}